  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIf a page is in a background tab and comes out of bfcache, visibility doesn't automatically change to \"visible\". Firefox and Chrome dispatch a single visibilitychange event and state is \"hidden\". Webkit on linux dispatches two events, and state is in both cases \"hidden\".",
